# Normalise line endings on the way into the repo.
#
# Without this, editing on Windows/WSL rewrote every vendored file with CRLF
# and `git status` showed the entire FortyGuard template as modified — 18,000
# lines of churn across files NOTICE.md says are used unmodified. Anyone
# reviewing the repo saw a rewritten template rather than the original.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary

# Notebooks are JSON but diff badly; keep them LF and out of merge attempts.
*.ipynb text eol=lf
